  "description": "***WELCOME TO THE CURSED ONLY GUILD***\n- Embracing the Cursed Life\n- A branch of the &quot;Forsaken&quot; guild\n\n*As you enter, a chill hangs in the air…* \nWhispers echo through the dark hallways, woven with stories of the cursed, as shadows move silently along the stone walls.\nCandles flicker on ancient tables, casting strange shapes as cursed adventurers gather to share tales and strategies.\nThough our ranks are young, our ambition is fierce. Join us in preparing for a future where the cursed shall rise together.\n\n**LEADERSHIP**\n\n*Guild Master - The highest keeper of cursed wisdom:*\n- tteokinou (aka momokinou)\n\n*Guild Officers - Those with some cursed knowledge, willing to share among their pears:*\n\n- CursedSuga\n- LuminousGrace\n\n**REQUIREMENTS**\n\n- Cursed Class \n- Open to all cursed, no level or combat requirements  \n- Dedication to the cursed path  \n\n**FUTURE PLANS**  \n- Organized Raids\n\n**JOIN US**  \nFeel free to join our discord together with your cursed, for fun chats, strategic discussions and general good fun: https://discord.gg/5jCdWF2dVb\n\nBecome part of the Cursed Only Guild today – the shadows await your arrival!\n\nNot a cursed, but forsaken, see: \nhttps://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=12",
